title: Aruba Central: Access Point Clients
agents: linux, windows
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Number of wireless clients associated with an Aruba access point.
 cencli leaves the client count out when an access point has no clients,
 which the check reports as zero.

 Without a rule the check only records the metric and stays OK. Upper
 levels can be configured with the rule "Aruba access point clients".

perfdata:
 One value: the number of connected clients.

inventory:
 One service per access point.
